  "description": "GUFCOB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H100 Cl2 N8 O18 Tb4 2+,5(C1 H4 O1),4(C1 H2 Cl2),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.552-3.895 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.80-110.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C98H120Cl12Tb4N8O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
